title: "prompt-defense-audit"
abstract: >
  A 12-vector static checker for LLM system prompt hardening, backed by a
  1,646-prompt attack corpus. Integrated into security frameworks at
  Microsoft, Cisco, OWASP, and UK Government AISI as of June 2026.
type: software
license: MIT
